        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You grew up in a region where undead lurk everywhere. This could be a domain as small as a vampire's fief or as vast as the nation of Ustalav. As an ever-present concern, the undead greatly shaped your life. Living with fear became an everyday skill... as did pleading for your life."
          }
        ]
      },
